---
import DirectionLayout from '../../../layouts/DirectionLayout.astro';
---
<DirectionLayout title="聲音通信｜知識網站方向 05" description="給 Podcast 主持人與聲音型知識創作者的深色廣播台式首頁。">
  <main id="main" class="ra-site">
    <header class="ra-header"><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'} class="ra-logo"><span class="ra-dot"></span>夜航信號 <small>RADIO LETTER / 05</small></a><nav aria-label="聲音通信導覽"><a href="#now">正在播放</a><a href="#archive">節目索引</a><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'}>比較站型 ↗</a></nav><span class="ra-live"><i></i> SIGNAL OPEN</span></header>
    <section class="ra-hero" id="now"><div class="ra-hero-copy"><p class="ra-kicker">A SMALL SIGNAL IN THE NIGHT</p><h1>按下播放，<br /><em>這封信說給你聽。</em></h1><p>一個關於想法、生活與那些還在形成中的答案的聲音節目。</p><a class="ra-transcript-link" href="#episode-notes">打開本期逐字稿 <span>↘</span></a></div><figure class="ra-cover"><img src="https://tenwebs-6qkx6x5p.manus.space/images/directions/k-radio-letter.webp" alt="夜色中的廣播麥克風、耳機與混音器" /><figcaption><span>ON AIR / 018</span><span>AI VOICE SAMPLE · ~00:25</span></figcaption></figure><div class="ra-wave" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:46},(_,i)=><i style={`--bar:${((i*17)%7)+2};--lag:${i*13}ms`}></i>)}</div></section>
    <section class="ra-player-note"><span class="ra-playing-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p id="ra-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">此處播放 AI 合成語音示意，並非主持人錄音；正式上線請換成自有授權音檔。</p><audio id="ra-audio" class="ra-audio" controls preload="metadata" aria-label="聲音通信 AI 語音示範播放器"><source src="https://tenwebs-6qkx6x5p.manus.space/audio/demo-episode.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />您的瀏覽器不支援音訊播放，請閱讀下方逐字稿。</audio><a href="#archive">先逛節目索引 ↓</a></section>
    <section class="ra-episode" id="episode-notes"><header><p class="ra-kicker">EP. 018 / FIELD RECORDING</p><h2>我們怎麼知道，<br />什麼值得留下來？</h2><p>從一張沒寄出的明信片，談記憶、選擇，以及被時間留下來的東西。</p></header><div class="ra-transcript"><p class="ra-time">00:00:18</p><p>有時候，我們不是沒有故事，而是還不知道要從哪一段開始說。今天這封信，想從一張沒有寄出的明信片開始。</p><p class="ra-time">00:04:32</p><p>後來我才發現，留下來的不是最完整的那個版本，反而是那些有一點猶豫、還保留著當時語氣的片段。</p><p class="ra-time">00:12:06</p><p>如果你願意，也可以找一件最近沒有丟掉的小東西，問問它為什麼還在這裡。</p><a href="#archive">閱讀完整逐字稿 ↗</a></div></section>
    <section class="ra-archive" id="archive"><div class="ra-archive-head"><p class="ra-kicker">ARCHIVE / RECENT LETTERS</p><h2>往期信號</h2><span>依播出時間排列</span></div><ol><li><span>017 / 09.18</span><a href="#episode-notes">在忙碌裡留一段可以呼吸的空白</a><span>16:08</span></li><li><span>016 / 09.04</span><a href="#episode-notes">一本書如何陪我們走過轉彎</a><span>21:30</span></li><li><span>015 / 08.20</span><a href="#episode-notes">先記錄，再決定它的名字</a><span>13:52</span></li></ol></section>
    <script is:inline>
      (() => {
        const audio = document.getElementById('ra-audio');
        const status = document.getElementById('ra-status');
        const site = document.querySelector('.ra-site');
        if (!audio || !status || !site) return;
        audio.addEventListener('play', () => {
          site.setAttribute('data-speaking', 'true');
          status.textContent = '正在播放 AI 合成語音示意；這不是主持人本人錄音。';
        });
        audio.addEventListener('pause', () => {
          site.removeAttribute('data-speaking');
          if (!audio.ended) status.textContent = 'AI 語音示意已暫停；下方逐字稿仍可閱讀。';
        });
        audio.addEventListener('ended', () => {
          site.removeAttribute('data-speaking');
          status.textContent = 'AI 語音示意播放完成；正式上線請替換為授權的節目音檔。';
        });
        audio.addEventListener('error', () => {
          site.removeAttribute('data-speaking');
          status.textContent = '示意音檔無法載入；請閱讀下方逐字稿。';
        });
      })();
    </script>
    <footer class="ra-footer"><span>夜航信號 / 聲音與文字的往返信件</span><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'}>返回十二種網站方向 ↗</a><span>NO SIGNAL IS ALSO A SIGNAL.</span></footer>
  </main>
</DirectionLayout>
<style>
.ra-site{--ra-ink:#eceee9;--ra-dim:#9ea9b5;--ra-bg:#111a24;--ra-cyan:#6fe0d2;--ra-orange:#ff9364;min-height:100vh;background:var(--ra-bg);color:var(--ra-ink);padding:0 clamp(1rem,4vw,4rem) 2rem;font-family:Arial,"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif}.ra-header{height:84px;border-bottom:1px solid #34404c;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}.ra-logo{text-decoration:none;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem}.ra-logo small{font: .52rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-dim);display:block;letter-spacing:.09em}.ra-dot,.ra-live i,.ra-playing-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ra-orange);display:inline-block;box-shadow:0 0 14px #ff936480}.ra-header nav{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;font: .67rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#c0c9cf}.ra-header nav a{text-decoration:none}.ra-live{font: .59rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-cyan);letter-spacing:.1em}.ra-live i{width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--ra-cyan);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--ra-cyan);margin-right:.4rem}.ra-hero{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;min-height:600px;padding:4rem 0 3rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;column-gap:5vw;align-items:center;position:relative}.ra-kicker{font: .62rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-cyan);letter-spacing:.14em}.ra-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.6rem,7vw,7.1rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:1rem 0}.ra-hero h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:var(--ra-cyan)}.ra-hero-copy>p:not(.ra-kicker){max-width:470px;color:#bbc2c7;line-height:1.8}.ra-transcript-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ra-cyan);padding-bottom:.4rem;text-decoration:none;font: .7rem ui-monospace,monospace}.ra-transcript-link span{color:var(--ra-cyan);margin-left:1rem}.ra-cover{margin:0;position:relative;transform:rotate(1deg)}.ra-cover img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.83);border:1px solid #374955}.ra-cover figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--ra-dim);font: .57rem ui-monospace,monospace;padding:.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #34404c}.ra-wave{grid-column:1/-1;height:70px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:2.5rem;border-top:1px solid #34404c;border-bottom:1px solid #34404c;padding:0 1rem}.ra-wave i{display:block;flex:1;max-width:13px;height:calc(var(--bar)*7px);background:linear-gradient(0deg,#344e5c,var(--ra-cyan));opacity:.62;border-radius:5px}.ra-site[data-speaking="true"] .ra-wave i{animation:ra-pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;animation-delay:var(--lag)}@keyframes ra-pulse{to{transform:scaleY(.45);opacity:.35}}.ra-player-note{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto 5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #34404c;padding:1rem 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;color:var(--ra-dim);font-size:.72rem}.ra-player-note p{margin:0;flex:1}.ra-player-note a{color:var(--ra-cyan);font: .6rem ui-monospace,monospace}.ra-audio{width:min(300px,100%);height:40px;flex:0 1 300px;color-scheme:dark}.ra-audio:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ra-cyan);outline-offset:3px}.ra-playing-dot{background:var(--ra-cyan);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--ra-cyan)}.ra-site[data-speaking="true"] .ra-playing-dot{animation:ra-pulse 1.3s infinite alternate}.ra-episode{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto 6rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:6vw}.ra-episode header h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:.7rem 0 1rem}.ra-episode header>p:last-child{color:var(--ra-dim);line-height:1.8;max-width:380px}.ra-transcript{border-left:1px solid #3a4a55;padding-left:1.5rem}.ra-time{font: .6rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-cyan);margin:1rem 0 .4rem}.ra-transcript p:not(.ra-time){line-height:1.9;color:#d1d5d4;margin:0 0 1.5rem}.ra-transcript>a{font: .65rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-cyan)}.ra-archive{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto 5rem;border-top:1px solid #46535e;padding-top:1.2rem}.ra-archive-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.ra-archive-head h2{font-size:2rem;margin:0}.ra-archive-head span{font: .6rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-dim)}.ra-archive ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.ra-archive li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 70px;gap:1rem;border-top:1px solid #34404c;padding:1rem 0;font: .68rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-dim)}.ra-archive li a{font: 1rem Georgia,"Noto Serif TC",serif;color:var(--ra-ink);text-decoration:none}.ra-archive li a:hover{color:var(--ra-cyan)}.ra-archive li>span:last-child{text-align:right}.ra-footer{border-top:1px solid #34404c;padding:1rem 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font: .57rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ra-dim)}.ra-footer a{color:var(--ra-cyan)}@media(max-width:760px){.ra-header{height:auto;padding:1rem 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.ra-header nav{order:3;width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.ra-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:3rem 0;gap:2rem}.ra-cover{width:85%;margin-left:auto}.ra-wave{margin-top:1rem}.ra-episode{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.ra-player-note{align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.ra-player-note p{flex-basis:calc(100% - 30px)}.ra-audio{width:100%;max-width:100%;flex-basis:100%}}@media(max-width:480px){.ra-live{font-size:.5rem}.ra-header nav{font-size:.6rem;gap:.5rem}.ra-hero h1{font-size:15vw}.ra-cover{width:100%}.ra-archive li{grid-template-columns:78px 1fr 48px;font-size:.58rem;gap:.5rem}.ra-archive li a{font-size:.86rem}.ra-footer{flex-direction:column}}
/* QA15: reuse Editorial label/body tokens and the approved 14px editorial nav scale. */
.ra-site{--ed-fs-label:.75rem;--ed-fs-body:1rem;--ra-nav-size:.875rem}
.ra-header nav{font-size:var(--ra-nav-size);gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ra-header nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;padding:.5rem;line-height:1.5}
.ra-header nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ra-cyan);outline-offset:2px}
.ra-logo small,.ra-live,.ra-kicker,.ra-transcript-link,.ra-cover figcaption,.ra-player-note a,.ra-time,.ra-transcript>a,.ra-archive-head span,.ra-archive li,.ra-footer{font-size:var(--ed-fs-label);line-height:1.5}
.ra-cover figcaption{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem}
.ra-player-note{font-size:var(--ed-fs-body);line-height:1.75}
.ra-player-note a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px}
@media(max-width:480px){.ra-archive-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem;align-items:start}.ra-header nav{font-size:var(--ra-nav-size);gap:0}.ra-live{font-size:var(--ed-fs-label)}.ra-logo{flex-wrap:wrap}.ra-archive li{font-size:var(--ed-fs-label)}}
</style>